[155.464691, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[155.51827, "o", "stacks/hardened/docker-compose.yml: 5 containers (read only, nothing is started)\r\nA container = one program and the files it needs, run as an isolated process on this host.\r\n\r\n  service   image (name:version)                     ports                 who can reach it\r\n  ollama    ollama/ollama:0.40.11                    expose 11434          other containers only: no host port\r\n  vllm      vllm/vllm-openai:v0.32.0                 expose 8000           other containers only: no host port\r\n  triton    nvcr.io/nvidia/tritonserver:25.07-py3    expose 8001           other containers only: no host port\r\n  ray-head  rayproject/ray:2.59.0                    expose 8265           other containers only: no host port\r\n  gateway   tsg/inference-gateway:lab                127.0.0.1:8443:8443   host port 8443: 127.0.0.1 only (this host)\r\n\r\n\"8000:8000\" = host port 8000 -> container port 8000 on every host address.\r\n\"127.0.0.1:8443:8443\" = the same, for this host only.  \"expose\" = no port on the host at all.\r\n"]
